abstract: "Arduino library for the Apis LiDAR rangefinder board. Apis manages power
  supply, firmware watchdog, and I2C communication for a LiDAR Lite unit, and reads
  a MEMS accelerometer to report pitch and roll — useful when the sensor is not mounted
  level."
